<title>JORDAN: Jordanian PM Kabariti to be replaced-sources.</title>
<headline>Jordanian PM Kabariti to be replaced-sources.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan's Prime Minister Abdul-Karim al-Kabariti will offer his resignation to King Hussein on Wednesday, sources said.</p>
<p>The sources told Reuters Kabariti would be replaced by former prime minister Abdul-Salam al-Majali, who will appoint a new cabinet.</p>
